    "text": "By Mike Schumann IUFB NFL ,\n4 hours ago The 2025 NFL season is underway, and six former Hoosiers saw the field in week seven. Here’s a quick overview of how they performed. Feeney played one offensive snap and one special teams snaps in a loss to the Lions. Feeney has now played in 122 games over nine NFL seasons. Tampa Bay is his fifth NFL team on the active roster. He is the longest-tenured Hoosier in the league. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
